  "term_and_condition": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Welcome to Modatna! Thank you for joining our Affiliate Program.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">These terms and conditions apply to individuals accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (&ldquo;we&rdquo; or &ldquo;merchant&rdquo;) and as an affiliate (&ldquo;you&rdquo; or &ldquo;affiliate&rdquo;) who refers customers to the merchant's products or services.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">By participating in the Program, you agree to use the Program as specified in these Terms and Conditions and are bound by them. If you do not agree with these Terms and Conditions in their entirety, you are not authorized to register as an Affiliate or participate in the Program.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Approval or Rejection of Registration<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">We reserve the right to approve or reject any Affiliate Program registration at our sole discretion. You have no legal recourse against us for the rejection of your registration.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Affiliate Links and Coupons<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">An affiliate link is automatically generated, but you can also generate a specific affiliate link for a product or collection. If a person clicks on multiple referral links, the last one clicked will count.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Affiliates may be assigned a coupon code with details and usage specified on the Dashboard. If a customer both clicks on the affiliate link and uses the coupon code, you will not receive a double commission. If you&rsquo;re not assigned a branded coupon, you&rsquo;re not allowed to promote the coupon.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Affiliates may advertise the merchant's website on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram, etc., or through offline channels like classified ads, magazines, and newspapers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Commissions and Payment<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">When you refer a customer who makes a purchase on our website, you will receive a commission based on the Commission Structure. The commission amount is dependent on the order value and excludes additional fees (e.g., tax, shipping).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">To receive a commission, you must specify your payment details in the Settings. The payment schedule is available on the Affiliate Guide page.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Payments will be sent only for successfully completed transactions. The use of the Affiliate Program is subject to a fair use policy, allowing the merchant to review each referral order. The status of your commission is displayed in the Commission tab, and any paid commission is listed in the Payment tab. Transactions resulting in chargebacks or refunds will not be paid.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Marketing Tools<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">We may share promotional media such as banners, logos, or specific collection promotions through the Marketing Tool tab. You can download the media or obtain the HTML embed code to share on affiliate channels.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Network<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">If the Network tab is activated, affiliates can invite others to become their downline affiliates. If a downline affiliate generates orders, the upline affiliate will also receive a network commission as per merchant settings.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">To invite other affiliates, share your network link. Any affiliate who clicks on this link and signs up will become your downline affiliate.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Cookies<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">We use cookies to track individuals who click on your link, so they must have cookies enabled for us to track them.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">If a person disables cookies or clears them, we cannot track their activity, and therefore, cannot pay earnings on that activity.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">The duration of the cookie is specified in the Affiliate Registration form. The tracking period starts when a customer clicks on the affiliate&rsquo;s link or uses the coupon. Within this period, any order made by the customer on the merchant&rsquo;s website will automatically result in a commission to the affiliate.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Removal from the Referral Program<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">If you wish to be removed from the affiliate program, you can do so by contacting info@modatna.com.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Thank you for reviewing these important terms. We wish you the best of luck in your affiliate endeavors. For any questions, feel free to chat or email us at info@modatna.com for support.a</span><o:p></o:p></p>",
